<title>UK: BOC seeks New York listing for ADRs.</title>
<headline>BOC seeks New York listing for ADRs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial gases to healthcare company BOC Group Plc said it has filed an application with the New York Stock Exchange for a listing of a sponsored ADR programme based on existing ordinary shares.</p>
<p>BOC said Morgan Guaranty Trust Co of New York will act as depositary.</p>
<p>Listing is expected to start on September 18.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
